  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.25 Re-entry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.25 “Re-entry” means a program specifically designed to bridge the transition from confinement to free society and to assist the person under departmental control in making the transition to become a contributing law abiding citizen.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #12500, eff 3-23-18",
